      "statement": "Adding a Yarn version requires recording its digest against an upstream record — the bin/yarn.js file of @yarnpkg/cli-dist on the npm registry or the hash for that version in Corepack's configuration — because the bundle is served from the location Corepack fetches Yarn 2 and later from.",
